### Create Order
POST http://localhost:3001/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user-124",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "prod-002",
      "productName": "Laptop 2",
      "quantity": 1,
      "price": 999.99
    },
    {
      "productId": "prod-003",
      "productName": "Mouse 2",
      "quantity": 2,
      "price": 39.99
    }
  ]
}

### Get All Orders
GET http://localhost:3001/orders

### Get Order by ID (replace with actual ID)
GET http://localhost:3001/orders/{{orderId}}

### Get All Payments
GET http://localhost:3002/payments

### Get Payment by Order ID
GET http://localhost:3002/payments/order/{{orderId}}

### Get All Products (Inventory)
GET http://localhost:3003/inventory/products

### Get Reservations by Order
GET http://localhost:3003/inventory/reservations/order/{{orderId}}

### Get All Notifications
GET http://localhost:3004/notifications

### Get Notifications by Order
GET http://localhost:3004/notifications/order/{{orderId}}

### Health Checks / Metrics
GET http://localhost:3001/metrics
GET http://localhost:3002/metrics
GET http://localhost:3003/metrics
GET http://localhost:3004/metrics
